## Proposed Changes

### Database Layer

#### [NEW] [20260224_chat_system.sql](file:///c:/BisugenTech/Projects/03_Leads_Nearby/area-lead-deal-e8835f78/supabase/migrations/20260224_chat_system.sql)
- Creates `conversations`, `conversation_participants`, `messages`, `user_keys` tables
- Sets up RLS policies for security
- Creates indexes for performance
- Enables Realtime on `messages` table

---

### Encryption Library

#### [NEW] [crypto.ts](file:///c:/BisugenTech/Projects/03_Leads_Nearby/area-lead-deal-e8835f78/src/lib/crypto.ts)
- `generateKeyPair()` → ECDH P-256 key pair
- `deriveSharedKey(privateKey, publicKey)` → AES-256-GCM key
- `encryptMessage(sharedKey, plaintext)` → `{ ciphertext, iv }`
- `decryptMessage(sharedKey, ciphertext, iv)` → plaintext
- `exportPublicKey(key)` / `importPublicKey(jwk)` → JWK format
- Uses IndexedDB for private key storage

---

### Chat Service Layer

#### [NEW] [chat.ts](file:///c:/BisugenTech/Projects/03_Leads_Nearby/area-lead-deal-e8835f78/src/lib/chat.ts)
- `getOrCreateConversation(userId, otherUserId, leadId?)` → finds or creates a conversation
- `sendMessage(conversationId, plaintext)` → encrypts + inserts into `messages`
- [fetchMessages(conversationId)](file:///c:/BisugenTech/Projects/03_Leads_Nearby/area-lead-deal-e8835f78/src/pages/Community.tsx#78-107) → fetches + decrypts messages
- `fetchConversations(userId)` → lists all conversations with last message preview
- `subscribeToMessages(conversationId, callback)` → Supabase Realtime subscription
- [markAsRead(conversationId)](file:///c:/BisugenTech/Projects/03_Leads_Nearby/area-lead-deal-e8835f78/src/pages/Notifications.tsx#100-110) → updates `last_read_at`

---

### Frontend — Chat Page

#### [NEW] [Messages.tsx](file:///c:/BisugenTech/Projects/03_Leads_Nearby/area-lead-deal-e8835f78/src/pages/Messages.tsx)
- **Layout**: Split view — conversation list (left) + chat window (center)
- **Mobile**: Full-screen list → tap to open chat → back button to return
- **URL**: `/messages` and `/messages?lead=<leadId>` (auto-opens lead-specific chat)
- **Components**:
  - `ConversationList` — Shows all chats with name, last message preview, unread badge, timestamp
  - `ChatWindow` — Message bubbles, auto-scroll, typing area, send button
  - `MessageBubble` — Sent (right, green) / Received (left, gray) with timestamp

