## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `npx tsc --noEmit` — TypeScript compilation
- Verify Supabase migration applies cleanly

### Manual Verification
1. Open Lead Details → click "Chat with Lead Generator" → verify chat opens
2. Send a message → verify it appears in real-time for the other user
3. Check Supabase `messages` table → verify `ciphertext` column contains encrypted data (not plaintext)
4. Open `/messages` → verify conversation list shows all chats
5. Test mobile responsive layout
6. Test dark mode consistency

