## Implementation Order

1. **SQL migration** — Create tables + RLS policies
2. **`crypto.ts`** — Encryption utilities
3. **`chat.ts`** — Chat service layer (CRUD + Realtime)
4. **`Messages.tsx`** — Chat page UI
5. **Wire up** — Routes, navigation, LeadDetails integration
6. **Update [types.ts](file:///c:/BisugenTech/Projects/03_Leads_Nearby/area-lead-deal-e8835f78/src/integrations/supabase/types.ts)** — Add new table types
7. **Test** — Verify E2E flow
